	// Attendant 2 serves rows: 3, 4, 7, 8, 11, 12, ...
	// Pattern: rows 1,2 -> A1; rows 3,4 -> A2; rows 5,6 -> A1; rows 7,8 -> A2; ...
	// So for row n, if (n-1)/2 is even, it's attendant 1, else attendant 2
	// Actually: rows 1,2 -> group 0 (A1), rows 3,4 -> group 1 (A2), rows 5,6 -> group 2 (A1), etc.
	// group = (n-1) / 2
