	// For attendant 1:
	//   Serves row 1 at time 0 (start), finishes at time 6
	//   Moves to row 2 (1 sec), serves row 2, finishes at time 6+1+6=13
	//   Moves 3 rows to row 5 (3 sec), serves row 5, finishes at time 13+3+6=22
	//   Moves 1 row to row 6 (1 sec), serves row 6, finishes at time 22+1+6=29
	//   Moves 3 rows to row 9 (3 sec), serves row 9, finishes at time 29+3+6=38
	//   ...

