	//   Serves row 3 at time 0 (start), finishes at time 6
	//   Moves to row 4 (1 sec), serves row 4, finishes at time 6+1+6=13
	//   Moves 3 rows to row 7 (3 sec), serves row 7, finishes at time 13+3+6=22
	//   Moves 1 row to row 8 (1 sec), serves row 8, finishes at time 22+1+6=29
